  "title": "Tronox Declares Second Quarter 2026 Dividend",
  "summary": "STAMFORD, Conn., April 28, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Tronox Holdings plc (NYSE:TROX), the world’s leading integrated manufacturer of titanium dioxide pigment, announced today that its Board of Directors declared a quarterly dividend of $0.05 per share. The dividend is payable on July 8, 2026 to shareholders of record at the close of business on May 11, … Continue reading \"Tronox Declares Second Quarter 2026 Dividend\"",
